# P0-19 neutral names (docs/jellyfin/05-plan.md P0-19, 04 §5.4). `Old New`, whole words.
# String literals are never rewritten, so persisted keys, logger categories
# and wire strings stay byte-identical. MediaServiceError keeps the NSError
# domain "Dusk.PlexServiceError" that error reports send (CustomNSError, added
# by hand after this table runs).

PlexServiceError            MediaServiceError
PlexServer                  AccountServer
PlexConnection              ServerEndpoint
PlexExtraType               ExtraKind
PlexGuid                    ItemGuid
PlexScrubPreviewFrame       ScrubPreviewFrame
PlexScrubPreviewSource      ScrubPreviewFrameSet
PlexLibraryVisibility       LibraryVisibility
PlexLibraryFilter           LibraryFilterEntry
PlexLibraryFilterValue      LibraryFilterValue
PlexContentRating           ContentRatingLabel
PlexPerson                  PersonDetails
PlexPersonReference         PersonReference
PlexManagedHub              ManagedHub
PlexManagedHomeRow          ManagedHomeRow
PlexHubSource               HomeRowSource
PlexPlaylistAddResult       PlaylistAddResult
PlexHomeHubSetting          HomeLayoutHub
plexHomeHubs                homeLayoutHubs
